  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy service for EU-agreements regarding development cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives of the desired consultancy services are; Assistance with regard to:
- Enhancement of compliance of development cooperation under delegated cooperation agreements between EU and Denmark
- Recovery orders linked to inappropriately execution of contracts due to lack of knowledge.
- Addressing EU audit requirements &#x2013; e.g. contacting partners and acquiring relevant documents.
- Preparation of new EU engagements utilizing all aspects of EU guidelines.
- Assisting development of internal guidelines for administration of EU funds for the MFA staff and partners
- Preparation and conducting tutorial material and sessions for designated DMFA staff and partners.

The Danish Ministry of Foreign Affairs is developing a new strategic approach to EU funding, therefore it will be possible to draw from the consultants experience on how best to tap into this &#x201c;market&#x201d; for agreements as well as how to organize the work internal in Danish Ministry of Foreign Affairs.</narrative>
  </description>
